WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Review campaign moderation · Confirm the campaign and
its schedule before ending or cancelling it. Add a
reason for the moderation record.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Set the campaign schedule · Set the start and end in
the store time zone. Switch to the UTC editor to enter
an exact instant when local clock times repeat.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Check variant prices and allocations · Review the
enrolled variant, offer price, and quantity. Preview
bulk enrollment before saving changes.

4
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Prepare a vendor-funded proposal · In the store
workspace, choose your variant and review the price,
quantity, and maximum markdown before submitting it
for approval.

5
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Find a live campaign · Open a campaign to see which
variants qualify. Upcoming campaigns show when their
offers begin.

6
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Check the exact variant · Follow the offer to the
selected variant. Verify its price and quantity before
adding it to your cart.

7
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Review the cart before checkout · Check the offer
price and quantity on the cart line. Review any
updated amounts before placing the order.
